    {
      "caption": "Kinetic theory links pressure to molecule motion",
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "id": "s3",
      "narration": "Kinetic theory turns those collisions into an equation: pressure times volume equals one third of N times the molecular mass times the mean-square speed. Faster molecules, or more of them in the box, give a higher pressure.",
